cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Coati"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Conversion of model results to JSON for the EnerPlanET platform: a Python
  package and command line tool that read the netCDF and HDF5 result files of
  Calliope, PyPSA and AdOpT-NET0 and write what a solved model says, in the
  same terms for every framework, or everything that a file holds.
